      "id": "claim_b50deacab2de4a6581f5e8a0c7a39a78",
      "statement": "pin-skill installs a skill into .agents/skills/<name>/ (project) or ~/.agents/skills/<name>/ (user) by taking load_skill's sha and file list, calling get_skill_archive for that sha, downloading the tar in the shell with the X-Harness-Archive-Token header, checking size and sha256 against the descriptor, re-minting once on 403, extracting into a temporary directory, comparing the file set with load_skill's list, writing a PINNED line, renaming atomically and symlinking .claude/skills/<name>; newer versions are detected by comparing PINNED's sha with list_skills.",
